      "text": "This Motorcycle Rental Agreement is entered into on {{agreement_date}} between {{owner_name}} (\"Owner\") and {{renter_name}} (\"Renter\"). Owner agrees to rent to Renter, and Renter agrees to rent from Owner, the following motorcycle/motor scooter:",
